# chip.px - power chip pickup, spinning gem
# canvas 8x8, 2 frames (spin pair, loop): a = facet face-on (full rhombus), b = turned edge-on (narrow).
# cyan ramp c C b w + steel-5 (6) as the white glint; K outline.
# light: top-left (upper-left facets w/6, lower-right C/c).
# smallest must-read feature: the white glint + w facet (2 px) so it sparkles at 1x.
# anchor: frame centre (4,4).
# timing: 100 ms each.
palette
. transparent
6 #e4ecfa  steel-5 glint
C #1d86b8  cyan-1
K #0b0d1a  outline shared-dark
b #46c8ee  cyan-2
c #0d4a6e  cyan-0
w #b2f4ff  cyan-3 glint
ramp cyan c C b w
frame a 100
...KK...
..K6bK..
.KwwbCK.
KwwwbCCK
KbbbCCcK
.KbCCcK.
..KCcK..
...KK...
frame b 100
...KK...
..K6bK..
..KwbK..
..KwCK..
..KbCK..
..KbcK..
..KbcK..
...KK...
